text: |-
  Orem Police Department's Post
  Orem Police Department •
  August 19, 2025 • 0
  We recently had three of our Records Service Specalists retire after
  many years of devoted service to Orem. Please join us in
  congratulating these ladies on a well-earned retirement!
  Chris started at Orem in 2005, Kim in 1996, and CJ in 1995. We are
  so grateful for their dedication to the citizens of Orem.
  Olivia Bishop
  Gonna miss these ladies!!
  40w Like Reply
  Comment as Steve Cameron
  GIF
